        "video_id": "G3W-LT79LSI",
        "lecture": 20,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "In the GPT setting, layer normalization is applied by taking the mean and variance across the embedding dimension for each row, which corresponds to each token embedding.",
