        "video_id": "G3W-LT79LSI",
        "lecture": 20,
        "kind": "procedure",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "In the forward method of the layer normalization class, the model takes the mean across columns, takes the variance across columns, subtracts the mean, and divides by the square root of the variance.",
