        "id": "G3W-LT79LSI:p063",
        "video_id": "G3W-LT79LSI",
        "lecture": 20,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "Layer normalization and batch normalization are very different from each other.",
        "line_ids": [
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2216",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2218",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2221",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2223",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2225",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2228",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2230"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "G3W-LT79LSI:p064",
        "video_id": "G3W-LT79LSI",
        "lecture": 20,
        "kind": "definition",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "In layer normalization, normalization is usually done along the feature dimension, which is the columns, and it does not depend on the batch size.",
        "line_ids": [
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2230",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2232",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2234",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2235",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2238",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2241"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "G3W-LT79LSI:p065",
        "video_id": "G3W-LT79LSI",
        "lecture": 20,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "In layer normalization, each layer's output is normalized using its mean and standard deviation regardless of batch size.",
        "line_ids": [
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2241",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2243",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2245",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2247"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "G3W-LT79LSI:p066",
        "video_id": "G3W-LT79LSI",
        "lecture": 20,
        "kind": "definition",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "In batch normalization, normalization is performed for an entire batch, so it depends on the batch size.",
        "line_ids": [
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2247",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2249",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2250",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2253",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2256"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "G3W-LT79LSI:p067",
        "video_id": "G3W-LT79LSI",
        "lecture": 20,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "Batch normalization is less flexible because batch size is often determined by available hardware.",
        "line_ids": [
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2256",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2258",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2260",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2262",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2265",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2267",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2269",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2271",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2274"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "G3W-LT79LSI:p068",
        "video_id": "G3W-LT79LSI",
        "lecture": 20,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "Layer normalization is more flexible because it is independent of batch size and provides more flexibility and stability for distributed training.",
        "line_ids": [
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2276",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2278",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2280",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2282",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2284"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "G3W-LT79LSI:p069",
        "video_id": "G3W-LT79LSI",
        "lecture": 20,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "When resources or hardware capabilities force small batch sizes, or when batch-size-independent normalization is desired, layer normalization is a better choice than batch normalization.",
        "line_ids": [
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2284",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2287",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2289",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2291",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2294",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2295",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2298",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2300",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2302"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "G3W-LT79LSI:p070",
        "video_id": "G3W-LT79LSI",
        "lecture": 20,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 1,
        "text": "Layer normalization is one of the building blocks needed to understand the GPT architecture, alongside components such as the GPT backbone, GELU activation, feed-forward networks, shortcut connections, and the transformer block.",
        "line_ids": [
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2156",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2158",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2160",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2164",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2165",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2168",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2170",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2171",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2174",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2176",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2178",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2181",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2182",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2185",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2187",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2189",
          "G3W-LT79LSI@2190",
